Package: dockpulse
Architecture: any
Description: Fast System, Docker, Compose & Swarm terminal monitor (Go Edition)
 A lightweight and fast terminal dashboard (TUI) written in Go to monitor
 host CPU, RAM, disk, network, Docker containers, Compose projects,
 and Swarm clusters.
